## Shell commands

This plugin adds argument parsing for the <code>semantic-release</code>
binary. Configuration:

```
alias: {"extends": ["e"]}
resolveInputs: (parsed, { cwd }) => {
    if (parsed.extends === 'false') return [];
    const inputs          = [];
    for (const value of [parsed.extends ?? []].flat()) {
      for (const part of String(value).split(',')) {
        const id = part.trim();
        if (isInternal(id)) inputs.push(toConfig('semantic-release', id, { dir: cwd }));
        else inputs.push(toDependency(id));
      }
    }
    return inputs;
  }
```

